        "description": "Additional foot malformations such as syndactyly or oligodactyly",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "family-history",
        "description": "Positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of congenital tibial aplasia or severe hypoplasia combined with ectrodactyly (split hand/foot malformation)",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may support diagnosis but is not definitive due to genetic heterogeneity."
  },
